    {
      "id": "IpHBluVZAvuxffggFjUWE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -376.363054853462,
      "y": -1646.651142595164,
      "width": 792.2313232421875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 170784420,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 75343780,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789558105176,
      "created": 1789558087504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Developers spend only about 24% of their time actually writing code, with the rest\ngoing to design, testing, debugging, and stakeholder meetings (Forrester Developer\nSurvey, 2024",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Developers spend only about 24% of their time actually writing code, with the rest going to design, testing, debugging, and stakeholder meetings (Forrester Developer Survey, 2024",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XJa1WkWcA3wkm71boptxB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 515.0784124316942,
      "y": -1652.323017595164,
      "width": 785.239013671875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1205443108,
      "version": 32,
      "versionNonce": 1686384028,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789558120932,
      "created": 1789558117739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Microsoft Research study of 484 developers found the typical workweek dedicates\nroughly 11% of time to coding, with the largest single activity being \"Communication &\nMeetings\" at ~12% (Microsoft Research, 2025).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Microsoft Research study of 484 developers found the typical workweek dedicates roughly 11% of time to coding, with the largest single activity being \"Communication & Meetings\" at ~12% (Microsoft Research, 2025).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y7NZB8rlaT1QdLPKTuE_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1430.9614690723192,
      "y": -1654.049580095164,
      "width": 763.879150390625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 552259876,
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 723710492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789558137772,
      "created": 1789558133546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "55% of development teams lose 5-15 hours per developer per week to unproductive\nwork, with \"time to gather context\" rated the top productivity leak (Cortex, State of\nDeveloper Productivity, 2024)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "55% of development teams lose 5-15 hours per developer per week to unproductive work, with \"time to gather context\" rated the top productivity leak (Cortex, State of Developer Productivity, 2024)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "spJfNYsHj35YzIymf82Z1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 957.0462943761386,
      "y": -1381.769462341541,
      "width": 793.739013671875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1525527716,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 576695460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789558235164,
      "created": 1789558170714,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Engineering teams don't have a building problem — they have a context problem:\ndevelopers spend as little as 11-24% of their week writing code, and the rest gets\nconsumed re-explaining and re-compressing context that already existed but was never\ncaptured.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Engineering teams don't have a building problem — they have a context problem: developers spend as little as 11-24% of their week writing code, and the rest gets consumed re-explaining and re-compressing context that already existed but was never captured.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UNPViutlm9DT6ivfqsPQj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1718.833999877455,
      "y": -965.6265216806462,
      "width": 365.97594930959315,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 273221284,
      "version": 65,
      "versionNonce": 1691196324,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789558229264,
      "created": 1789558211072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI SDLC solves this by making context a\npersistent, agent-managed layer that\nflows continuously across phases — so\nknowledge is captured once and reused\neverywhere, instead of being manually\nre-translated by humans at every\nhandoff.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI SDLC solves this by making context a persistent, agent-managed layer that flows continuously across phases — so knowledge is captured once and reused everywhere, instead of being manually re-translated by humans at every handoff.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
