      "width": 622.1531982421875,
      "height": 65,
      "text": "Agents carry out delegated work. People own decisions and approvals. \n\nRACI: R does the work · A owns the outcome · C is consulted · I is informed. Red bars mark approval gates.\nDeployment and operations follow the team's release process.",
